WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
The effect is to increase speed and strength for two people at the same time

2
00:00:03,320 --> 00:00:05,320
I haven't tried how much I can add.

3
00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:06,960
Although there is still this accumulated talent

4
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:08,520
Requires two people to activate

5
00:00:08,520 --> 00:00:10,360
Everyone starts with one room per person

6
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:12,360
Even if we cooperate, we still need to take precautions.

7
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:14,600
It seems that not all talents are powerful

8
00:00:15,040 --> 00:00:21,060
I need you to come to my room so we can meet and talk about Chen An

9
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:23,140
Do you want to buy this drawing?

10
00:00:23,420 --> 00:00:27,180
But its medicine price is a bit high

11
00:00:27,380 --> 00:00:28,940
Exactly what is needed now

12
00:00:29,260 --> 00:00:32,730
Installation will most likely improve room comfort, but

13
00:00:32,970 --> 00:00:34,730
There is no water connection in our room

14
00:00:34,970 --> 00:00:36,770
Can it be used if the toilet is installed directly?

15
00:00:36,770 --> 00:00:38,290
I hesitated because of this too

16
00:00:38,290 --> 00:00:40,770
And electronic components and batteries are also rare

17
00:00:40,770 --> 00:00:42,770
The story is that I really don’t want to go downstairs to use the toilet.

18
00:00:42,770 --> 00:00:44,690
Climbing stairs is too tiring and dangerous.

19
00:00:44,690 --> 00:00:45,650
Take a look at the price first

20
00:00:45,650 --> 00:00:47,090
If it's cheap, just take it

21
00:00:47,090 --> 00:00:48,330
Anyway, it will come in handy sooner or later.

22
00:00:48,330 --> 00:00:49,730
A drawing can only be made once

23
00:00:49,730 --> 00:00:50,650
Very high rarity
